{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04246","headline":"春晚从李长史游开道林故山 · 骆宾王","name":"春晚从李长史游开道林故山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽寻极幽壑，春望陟春台。\n云光栖断树，灵影入仙杯。\n古藤依格上，野径约山隈。\n落蘂飜风去，流莺满树来。\n兴阑荀御动，归路起浮埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}